# QA-009: Weigh sulfate in a mixed salt sample rather than all dissolved salts
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 Na2SO4 0.0005mol
add v1 NaCl 0.002mol
add v1 BaCl2 0.0006mol
new
filter v1 v2
measure v1 balance
inspect v1
measure v2 conductivity
inspect
